{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月23日，英偉達官網公告稱，公司董事會已一致投票決定，即日起恢復黃仁勳的總裁、行政總裁及董事職務。英偉達表示，董事會經過與黃仁勳多輪討論和會議，對其坦誠程度及領導公司能力表示認可，並認為恢復其職務符合股東、員工、合作夥伴及客户的最佳利益。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587688.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:36:50.453441+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:12:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T14:29:06.797977+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:29:06.797977+00:00","content_hash":"5829d0a37a44986e53f646f681d5269354779227b0946b956756c6e0faf69a40","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}